            <ArticleTitle>Developing and implementing a back injury prevention program in small companies.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>167-71</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Small businesses can reduce their accident rates, lost time days, and costs associated with low back pain if they implement a holistic back injury prevention program. This article describes the steps that a small business can take in designing and implementing such a program.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
